      "value": "@{5d3b19c1d91951671ce89ddc|full_name}: Wouldn't that cause more saturation overall though to sounds in general? At some point you would have to have a higher release time which may cause some other issues. A look ahead delay shouldn't be more than a few milliseconds so I don't understand how that could be an issue unless there would be something to do with the networking. As far as I would guess though, all compressors are calculated locally anyways.",
